      "sha256": "6d9c8bb0d51edd4c19a35c4b50ab520fd19b6cff1d7e7a12e8aa171cc75d0c64",
      "text": "# 四方法多任务预实验：最新完整阅读包\n\n[开始阅读](review_20261027_113750/README.md) · [最终比较](review_20261027_113750/results/asvc_multitask_external_v1/FINAL_SUMMARY.zh-CN.md) · [逐seed AULC](review_20261027_113750/results/asvc_multitask_external_v1/run_comparison.csv) · [学习曲线](review_20261027_113750/results/asvc_multitask_external_v1/learning_trend_review_20261027_104518/learning_trends_full.png)\n\n新增D3QN/DQfD各2seed，复用多任务C/D各2seed，全部500000在线步。仅冻结验证池，未评估两个测试池。C在当前预算表现最好；D碰撞较少、超时更多，无整体增益证据。两个seed不支持正式显著性结论。\n"
